> I've got a level one wizard who found a wand of wishing.  I know that
> I'm going to screw it up somehow, but I'd like some advice on what to
> wish for.
>
> I already got the scroll of charging, SDSM, and boots of speed.
>
> I'm wondering what to wish for next...

You *will* die if you're not careful.  "oLS is a *very* good thing to
get when you're 1st level.  I always get overconfident and forget that
I have only 11 hitpoints...

Don't be afraid to "waste" the wishes - it's important to survive 'till
you're 10th level!

I'd say get two "oLS :)  Then, depending on style, magic whistle, +oID,
Wand of Death.  Wait until you have a need that's unfulfilled.
Backpack full?  (oHolding.  Pet keeps getting lost?  Magic Whistle.
Lots of UnID'd junk?  You get the idea.  I like the idea of the Wand of
Death if you'll use it - a low level wizard is still terribly weak...

Be *very* careful about wishing for an Artifact - you're fist level; it
may kill you if you try to hold it!

